graph TD
    A[Client] -->|Place Order| B(Order Service)
    B -->|Publish| C{Kafka}
    C -->|update-cart| D[Update Cart Service]
    C -->|update-inventory| E[Update Inventory Service]
    C -->|payment| F[Payment Service]
    C -->|shipping| G[Shipping Service]
    D -->|Success/Failure| H{Kafka - Response}
    E -->|Success/Failure| H
    F -->|Success/Failure| H
    G -->|Success/Failure| H
    H -->|All Success| I[Complete Order]
    H -->|Any Failure| J[Initiate Compensation]
    J -->|Publish| K{Kafka - Compensation}
    K -->|update-cart-compensation| L[Update Cart Compensation]
    K -->|update-inventory-compensation| M[Update Inventory Compensation]
    K -->|payment-compensation| N[Payment Compensation]
    K -->|shipping-compensation| O[Shipping Compensation]
    L & M & N & O -->|Compensation Complete| P[Order Cancelled]
